Now you see actually
the models are not

01:12:34.560 --> 01:12:37.830
able to beat bzip2 or even gzip.

01:12:37.830 --> 01:12:39.120
Can anybody tell me why?

01:12:42.020 --> 01:12:45.650
Pali is like Sanskrit if
