01:13:59.740 --> 01:14:03.790
model on a short story,
again, released in 2023.

01:14:03.790 --> 01:14:05.500
He tried different
context lengths,

01:14:05.500 --> 01:14:08.500
and he got different
bits per byte,

01:14:08.500 --> 01:14:11.260
compressed bits per character.

01:14:11.260 --> 01:14:12.790
Higher context length, better.

01:14:12.790 --> 01:14:14.530
Nothing changed until now.

